│  telemetry         [x]              Send an anonymous usage report once a day (see README)                           │
│  compact_threshold 83.5             Context % at which the agent compacts. On restart                                │
│  today_window      calendar     ↻   calendar/rolling: Today is this day, or the last 24h                             │
